/E (FinFolio 1.0 already allowed users to calculate portfolio returns, inspect risk indicators, compare results with a benchmark and explore alternative weights. I therefore began by examining what the existing product could not explain clearly. Its investment coverage was relatively narrow, the dashboard contained many numbers in one place, and it did not fully show how individual holdings contributed to portfolio return or risk.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
