90 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 54 0 R
/E (I helped frame FinFolio 2.0 around a practical question: after an investor enters a portfolio, can the application explain what happened, which holdings or groups produced the result, and where the main risks lie? We chose self-directed retail investors and finance students with basic financial knowledge as the main users. They need a way to review a small multi-asset portfolio, not a trading platform or a source of automatic buy-and-sell advice.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
