/E (I had translated this direction into a set of calculation rules and review conditions. For return attribution, the parts had to equal the whole. For Euler risk, the holding contributions had to sum to estimated volatility. The FX components had to reproduce the VND return, while optimized allocations had to respect the stated caps. These checks gave the other workstreams clear targets beyond simply displaying a plausible number)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [6]
>>
