/Title (The current portfolio valuation framework mainly relies on historical price returns. It does not fully account for dividend reinvestment, transaction fees, taxes, additional deposits or withdrawals, or the timing of actual trades. As a result, the performance displayed by FinFolio should be understood as the historical performance of a hypothetical portfolio under the model's assumptions, rather than the exact realised profit or loss of an investor.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 438 0 R
>>
endobj
499 0 obj
<<
/Title (Second, differences in trading calendars create additional challenges for multi-asset portfolios.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 328 0 R
