558 0 obj
<<
/Title (One of the complexities of expanding FinFolio beyond Vietnamese equities is that financial instruments do not share identical trading schedules. While stock exchanges operate on designated trading days, cryptocurrencies can trade continuously, including weekends. FinFolio currently aligns assets using common available observations and applies a 252-session annualization convention.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 499 0 R
/Next 559 0 R
>>
endobj
559 0 obj
<<
/Title (This provides a consistent basis for portfolio-level analysis, but it does not capture every price movement of continuously traded assets. For instance, the system may record the net price change between Friday and Monday while missing a temporary but substantial weekend drawdown.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 499 0 R
/Prev 558 0 R
>>
endobj
